// Live loot filters: GitHub repositories whose filters every player gets, kept up to
// date by the launcher. Each lands in its own folder inside the player's filters folder,
//   <Saved Games>\Diablo II Resurrected\mods\Eastern_Sun_Resurrected\LootFilters\<folder>\
// and shows in the launcher's Loot Filter tab marked LIVE.
//
// The launcher checks every repository when it starts and every 10 minutes while it is
// open. A new commit is downloaded and, with the game running, applies in game at once.
// A commit whose filter .json is not valid JSON is skipped; players keep the last good one.
//
// What a filter repository holds (everything else in it is ignored):
//   <name>.json at the top   the filters
//   sounds\                  their .wav, .mp3 and .flac files (subfolders allowed)
//   icons\                   their .sprite minimap icons
//
// Each repository:
//   url      https://github.com/<owner>/<repository>
//   branch   optional. Default: the repository's default branch.
//   folder   optional. Default: the repository name. Only needed when two repositories
//            share a name.
// Taking a repository out of this list deletes its folder for every player.
{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "repositories": [
    { "url": "https://github.com/Thisisnotsully/QoL-Filter" }
  ]
}
